{"3825840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buried Cargo", "steam_appid": 3825840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Cargo</strong> is a first-person automation game where you interact with the world entirely through a terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone maintenance robot waking up inside a buried shipping container, deep beneath the remains of a forgotten civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic terminal commands to connect to conveyor units, printers, extractors, and scanners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up production lines, expand your small base, and unlock blueprints buried in layers of broken tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own automation network from the inside out, not through a cluttered UI, but with a clean, readable command line interface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedural Scrap Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget ore veins, every scrap block hides a random mix of materials.<br>Extract what you need, burn the rest for energy, and push your scrapyard walls outward to uncover more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modular Automation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Snap together conveyors, extractors, printers, and refiners to build flexible production chains. <br>Deploy new, higher-capacity units to boost your output as you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Break Walls and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Smash through walls to reveal hidden caves packed with scrap.<br>Reinforce and convert them into usable build zones to grow your automation network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Terminal-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect, configure, and control every unit through a clean text terminal using real command line interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No Tech Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blueprints are discovered, not unlocked.<br>Scan and disassemble scrap to uncover hidden designs and expand your build options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.webm?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.mp4?t=1777032982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Cargo</strong> is a first-person automation game where you interact with the world entirely through a terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone maintenance robot waking up inside a buried shipping container, deep beneath the remains of a forgotten civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic terminal commands to connect to conveyor units, printers, extractors, and scanners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up production lines, expand your small base, and unlock blueprints buried in layers of broken tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own automation network from the inside out, not through a cluttered UI, but with a clean, readable command line interface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedural Scrap Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget ore veins, every scrap block hides a random mix of materials.<br>Extract what you need, burn the rest for energy, and push your scrapyard walls outward to uncover more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.poster.avif?t=1777032982\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.webm?t=1777032982\" type=